### C4. Immediate Next Task

Must be specific enough to start coding safely.

Example:

```text
Immediate next task:
    CMS05-3B readable diagnostics and teardown proof.

Files/functions:
    vapoursynth-Cnr3.cpp
        cnr3_debug_print_output_cache_summary()
